1
00:00:00,416 --> 00:00:02,166
Father, he's goddamn miner!

2
00:00:02,708 --> 00:00:05,291
How in hell would
he know the Godfather?!

3
00:00:06,708 --> 00:00:07,791
Get on your knees.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,458
Apologize to my mother.

5
00:00:09,958 --> 00:00:11,916
Strip that bastard of his inheritance

6
00:00:11,916 --> 00:00:13,208
and throw both of them out.

7
00:00:15,125 --> 00:00:16,375
Then I'll have the Godfather heal you.

8
00:00:16,375 --> 00:00:17,291
Severin!

9
00:00:17,375 --> 00:00:19,791
You really think this
bullshit lie about knowing the

10
00:00:19,791 --> 00:00:21,958
Godfather will get you
back in Father's will?!

11
00:00:21,958 --> 00:00:22,916
You're pathetic!

12
00:00:22,916 --> 00:00:25,416
That inheritance you're so desperate for?

13
00:00:26,125 --> 00:00:27,708
It's worthless to me.

14
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:29,791
Then why'd you come back?

15
00:00:29,791 --> 00:00:31,666
If you don't care, get out!

16
00:00:32,416 --> 00:00:35,166
I came back to
watch this disaster unfold.

17
00:00:35,166 --> 00:00:37,541
And to collect what
this family owes me.

18
00:00:38,291 --> 00:00:40,625
I don't give a damn about Carter scraps.

19
00:00:41,083 --> 00:00:44,333
But I sure as hell won't
let you two parasites have them.

20
00:00:46,625 --> 00:00:49,958
Severin… just tell me where the Godfather is. I'll...

21
00:00:49,958 --> 00:00:51,208
I’ll...

22
00:00:51,208 --> 00:00:53,833
make it right for you and your mother.

23
00:00:54,666 --> 00:00:56,250
Those are my terms.

24
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:57,458
Live or die.

25
00:00:57,458 --> 00:00:58,708
Your choice.

26
00:00:58,708 --> 00:01:01,958
How dare you threaten the Count!

27
00:01:01,958 --> 00:01:03,916
I was wrong about you.

28
00:01:03,916 --> 00:01:05,166
I thought you were just pathetic,

29
00:01:05,166 --> 00:01:06,958
but you're completely rotten inside.

30
00:01:08,125 --> 00:01:08,875
You?

31
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:11,291
A woman like you has no right

32
00:01:11,291 --> 00:01:12,958
to lecture me about anything.

33
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:16,250
Severin, you jealous coward!

34
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:18,541
You just can't stand that I've surpassed you!

35
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,625
I'm honestly amazed a worthless piece of trash

36
00:01:21,625 --> 00:01:24,125
like you even
dares to marry me.

37
00:01:24,916 --> 00:01:25,750
Don't worry.

38
00:01:26,208 --> 00:01:28,166
I'll give you a wedding.

39
00:01:28,416 --> 00:01:30,000
One you'll never forget.

40
00:01:30,375 --> 00:01:31,125
You?

41
00:01:31,708 --> 00:01:32,916
A broke nobody?

42
00:01:33,291 --> 00:01:35,958
What kind of surprise
could you possibly give me?

43
00:01:35,958 --> 00:01:37,666
- Just wait and see.
- Shut up!

44
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:44,583
Send word.

45
00:01:44,583 --> 00:01:47,291
Tonight, I'm going announce…

46
00:01:47,291 --> 00:01:50,375
the heir of House Carter in front of everyone.
